Scoped Beam Software SIFF (SOUN) demuxer

The probe, the SOUN header checks (SIFF, SOUN, SHDR and its size, rate,
bits, BODY) and the block_align packet framing in src/siff.ts follow
libavformat/siff.c (siff_probe, siff_read_header, siff_parse_soun,
create_audio_stream, siff_read_packet).
